n>204</span><span>232</span><span>233</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"local-derivation-from-read-proofs"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>。沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6e0ceb35e6a34f4f\" href=\"?note=6e0ceb35e6a34f4f\" title=\"56-df-lexicographic-path-order\">56-df-lexicographic-path-order</a> 的严格 precedence <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\succ\">\\(\\succ\\)</span> 和参数优先排列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span>；假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}(F,\\succ)\">\\(\\mathrm{WF}(F,\\succ)\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall(l,r)\\in R\\;(l&gt;_{\\mathrm{lpo}}^{\\Sigma,V,\\succ,\\pi}r)\">\\(\\forall(l,r)\\in R\\;(l&gt;_{\\mathrm{lpo}}^{\\Sigma,V,\\succ,\\pi}r)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\to_R\\;\\subseteq\\;&gt;_{\\mathrm{lpo}}^{\\Sigma,V,\\succ,\\pi}\n\\quad\\land\\quad\\mathrm{Terminating}(T,\\to_R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\to_R\\;\\subseteq\\;&gt;_{\\mathrm{lpo}}^{\\Sigma,V,\\succ,\\pi}\n\\quad\\land\\quad\\mathrm{Terminating}(T,\\to_R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>由 LPO 为 reduction order 及 Proposition 6.1.3 得到；对应原书 Definition 6.4.5 后的终止推论的 LPO 特例。删除旧稿把几乎全书节点列为直接依赖的伪依赖；这里只保留实际用到的定义和定理。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003；6.1.3; 6.4.3–6.4.5，印刷页 183; 211–212。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 是本地 DjVu 文本层提取块序号，不是已确认的物理扫描页号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text